<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: Combat-->
  <VAERoy_Combat>战斗</VAERoy_Combat>
  <!--EN: Combat animals are specialized in melee combat. These animals have high attack damage, good resistance, high health, or other abilities that allow them to survive in the front lines.-->
  <VAERoy_CombatDesc>战斗动物专门从事近战战斗。这些动物具有高攻击力、良好的抵抗力、高生命值或其他使它们能够在前线生存的能力。</VAERoy_CombatDesc>
  <!--EN: Combat animals are specialized in melee combat. These animals have high attack damage, good resistance, high health, or other abilities that allow them to survive in the front lines.\n\nThis animal gets greatly increased melee attacks as it ages.-->
  <VAERoy_CombatDescInc>战斗动物专门从事近战战斗。这些动物具有高攻击力、良好的抵抗力、高生命值或其他能力，使它们能够在前线生存。

随着年龄的增长，这种动物的近战攻击力会大大增强。</VAERoy_CombatDescInc>
  <!--EN: Egg Layer-->
  <VAERoy_EggLayer>蛋层</VAERoy_EggLayer>
  <!--EN: This animal lays eggs-->
  <VAERoy_EggLayerDesc>这种动物产卵</VAERoy_EggLayerDesc>
  <!--EN: Primary Role-->
  <VAERoy_PrimaryRole>主要角色</VAERoy_PrimaryRole>
  <!--EN: Secondary Role-->
  <VAERoy_SecondaryRole>次要角色</VAERoy_SecondaryRole>
  <!--EN: Utility-->
  <VAERoy_Utility>公用事业</VAERoy_Utility>
  <!--EN: Utility - Building-->
  <VAERoy_UtilityBuilding>公用事业 - 建筑</VAERoy_UtilityBuilding>
  <!--EN: This animal is not suited for combat, being quite physically weak. It will however build nests that act as a very beautiful animal sleeping spot.-->
  <VAERoy_UtilityBuildingDesc>这种动物身体虚弱，不适合战斗。然而，它会建造巢穴，作为一个非常美丽的动物睡觉的地方。</VAERoy_UtilityBuildingDesc>
  <!--EN: Utility - Crowd Control-->
  <VAERoy_UtilityCrowd>实用程序 - 人群控制</VAERoy_UtilityCrowd>
  <!--EN: This animal is weak, but it has psychic abilities that can help with crowd control and survivavility.-->
  <VAERoy_UtilityCrowdDesc>这种动物很弱，但它具有心灵能力，可以帮助控制人群和生存。</VAERoy_UtilityCrowdDesc>
  <!--EN: Utility - Food-->
  <VAERoy_UtilityFood>公用事业 - 食品</VAERoy_UtilityFood>
  <!--EN: This is a farm animal that produces specialized meat.-->
  <VAERoy_UtilityFoodDesc>这是一种生产特殊肉类的农场动物。</VAERoy_UtilityFoodDesc>
  <!--EN: Utility - Heat Disipation-->
  <VAERoy_UtilityHeat>实用-散热</VAERoy_UtilityHeat>
  <!--EN: This animal is not suited for combat, being quite physically weak. It will however increase the neural heat disipation of a bonded colonist.-->
  <VAERoy_UtilityHeatDisipationDesc>这种动物身体虚弱，不适合战斗。然而，它会增加束缚殖民者的神经散热。</VAERoy_UtilityHeatDisipationDesc>
  <!--EN: Utility - Mood-->
  <VAERoy_UtilityMood>实用程序 - 心情</VAERoy_UtilityMood>
  <!--EN: This animal is not suited for combat, being quite physically weak. It will however increase the mood of your colonists.-->
  <VAERoy_UtilityMoodDesc>这种动物身体虚弱，不适合战斗。然而，它会增加殖民者的情绪。</VAERoy_UtilityMoodDesc>
  <!--EN: Utility - Psychic-->
  <VAERoy_UtilityPsychic>实用程序 - 心灵</VAERoy_UtilityPsychic>
  <!--EN: This animal is not suited for combat, being quite physically weak. It will however nuzzle your colonists periodically to increase their psychic sensitivity.-->
  <VAERoy_UtilityPsychicDesc>这种动物身体虚弱，不适合战斗。然而，它会定期用鼻子蹭你的殖民者，以增加他们的心灵敏感度。</VAERoy_UtilityPsychicDesc>
  <!--EN: Utility - Social-->
  <VAERoy_UtilitySocial>实用-社交</VAERoy_UtilitySocial>
  <!--EN: This animal is not suited for combat. It will instead engage your colonists in conversation, increasing their social recreation as well as giving them small amounts of experience in random skills.-->
  <VAERoy_UtilitySocialDesc>这种动物不适合战斗。相反，它会让你的殖民者参与对话，增加他们的社交娱乐，并为他们提供少量随机技能的经验。</VAERoy_UtilitySocialDesc>
</LanguageData>
